      "id": "V40_CONTEXT_FAILURE",
      "status": "RESOLVED_IN_V41_REVIEW_CANDIDATE",
      "evidence": "Actual whole-page review now shows both water areas, full left rope-post approach and landing, separated playground including seesaw, mountain trail/houses, current four-tower shoreline castle and the continuous stone route. The scene preserves the complete 6144x2048 native source width and native landmark spacing rather than a condensed row of familiar objects. My earlier V40 review missed that contextual failure; its byte checks did not establish visual success."
